WEBVTT

00:00:09,580 --> 00:00:14,000
I have added using a rebounder to my fitness routine,

00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:17,900
anything else that will help my lymph nodes do their job.

00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:20,580
As you know, I'm trying to get them to be clear

00:00:20,580 --> 00:00:24,220
when they take a few during my upcoming surgery.

00:00:25,860 --> 00:00:30,980
Well, your lymph nodes, your lymph vessels do not have heart

00:00:30,980 --> 00:00:35,380
that pumps the lymph through them, your lymph nodes

00:00:35,380 --> 00:00:39,300
and your lymph vessels rely on contraction of your muscles.

00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:43,580
So using your muscles contracting, using doing some weights,

00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:47,040
doing any muscle contracting things can be helpful.

00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:49,500
Moving your body is the biggest thing

00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:52,340
that's gonna help your lymph vessels.

